{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-14",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "全身心投入节目改版  (Throwing Herself Into the Revamp)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After staying awake all night in embarrassment over her unanswered invitation, Bu Xiaogu greets Xingzi and Kaiwen at dawn with handwritten cards listing the revamp's three obstacles. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，早啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "早，你昨晚一夜没睡啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "工作任务当前，没有上班下班之分。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我要全身心地投入到工作里去，证明我自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是啥呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是咱们节目改版面临的三大阻力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你要用意念化解他们，还是诅咒人家呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我要一个一个把他们全都解决掉！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "真好，真是宏图壮志啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我可以先去说服那些广告商啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大跟他们开了八回会都没说服他们，肯定给你面子，去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我去找邓主任商量商量，争取让电视台支持咱们。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，早啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good morning, Xingzi!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "早，你昨晚一夜没睡啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Morning—did you not sleep a wink last night?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "工作任务当前，没有上班下班之分。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With urgent work ahead of us, there is no line between on duty and off duty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我要全身心地投入到工作里去，证明我自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am going to throw myself heart and soul into the work to prove myself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是啥呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are these cards?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是咱们节目改版面临的三大阻力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These are the three major obstacles facing our show's revamp.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你要用意念化解他们，还是诅咒人家呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you trying to dissolve them with willpower, or put a hex on them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我要一个一个把他们全都解决掉！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am going to tackle and resolve every single one of them!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "真好，真是宏图壮志啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wonderful—what grand ambition!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我可以先去说服那些广告商啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can start by going to persuade those advertisers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大跟他们开了八回会都没说服他们，肯定给你面子，去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss held eight meetings without persuading them, so they will surely do it for you—off you go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我去找邓主任商量商量，争取让电视台支持咱们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I will talk things over with the network director and try to win the station's support.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，早啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
